{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "_comment": "HART OS canonical curated FOSS app catalog — the SINGLE source of truth read by BOTH nixos/modules/hart-apps.nix (bakes the preinstall set into environment.systemPackages) AND integrations/agent_engine/app_catalog.py (serves the offline App Store + appearance dedup). JSON is the only format both Nix (builtins.fromJSON) and Python (json.load) parse natively, so there is ONE list, no parallel copy. Each entry: id = Flathub reverse-DNS id (store identity + OPTIONAL Flathub poster source, never a gatekeeper); name/category/icon/description = display; preinstall = true means shipped in the base image (Open, not Install); package = nixpkgs attr the module bakes when preinstall=true (attr-guarded, a wrong/renamed attr can never break eval); exec = binary name the backend probes with shutil.which() to dedup installed-vs-catalog with the network OFF. No em dashes in any user-facing string.",
